  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Prevent Information Redacted in Climate Change affected communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Working with Information Redacted survivors, IOM will employ a comprehensive community-based model to create resilience to climate change through livelihood support, socio-economic services, behavior change, and a prevalence model on climate change and Information Redacted .</narrative>
  </description>
